    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025#sch-1-sec-28a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28A Function of Commission in relation to providing resources to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "the AER\nIn addition to any other functions conferred on the Commission,\nthe Commission may provide the AER with supports and resources\n(including corporate and information technology resources) to\nassist in the administration of the AER."
