      },
      "cml:premiseText": "a uniform energy law that applies as a law of a State or Territory;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "AER State/Territory energy law means..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-1-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 After subsection 44AE(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025#sch-1-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(1A) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n(a) the AER is a listed entity; and\n(b) the AER members are the accountable authority of the AER;\nand\n(c) the following persons are officials of the AER:\n(i) the AER members;\n(ii) the staff of the AER referred to in section 44AAC;\n(iii) persons assisting the AER referred to in\nsection 44AACA;\n(iv) consultants engaged under section 44AACB; and\n(d) the purposes of the AER include the functions of the AER\nunder Division 3 of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n(1A) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n(a) the AER is a listed entity; and\n(b) the AER members are the accountable authority of the AER;\nand\n(c) the following persons are officials of the AER:\n(i) the AER members;\n(ii) the staff of the AER referred to in section 44AAC;\n(iii) persons assisting the AER referred to in\nsection 44AACA;\n(iv) consultants engaged under section 44AACB; and\n(d) the purposes of the AER include the functions of the AER\nunder Division 3 of this Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-1-sec-5-norm"
        },
