      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The AER may be assisted by:\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Australian Energy Regulator\nSeparation) Act 2025\nNo. 59, 2025\n(a) officers and employees of Agencies (within the meaning of\nthe Public Service Act 1999), and of authorities of the\nCommonwealth, whose services are made available to the\nAER in connection with the performance of any of the\nAER’s functions; and\n(b) persons whose services are made available under\narrangements made under subsection (2).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The AER may be assisted by:\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Australian Energy Regulator\nSeparation) Act 2025\nNo. 59, 2025\n(a) officers and employees of Agencies (within the meaning of\nthe Public Service Act 1999), and of authorities of the\nCommonwealth, whose services are made available to the\nAER in connection with the performance of any of the\nAER’s functions; and\n(b) persons whose services are made available under\narrangements made under subsection (2).",
