    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025#sch-2-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIn this Schedule:\nACCC Enterprise Agreement means the Australian Competition and\nConsumer Commission Enterprise Agreement 2024-2027 approved\nunder the Fair Work Act 2009 on 28 March 2024, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day.\namending Act means the Competition and Consumer Amendment\n(Australian Energy Regulator Separation) Act 2025.\ncommencement day means 1 July 2026.\n(2)\nExpressions used in this Schedule that are defined for the purposes of\nthe Competition and Consumer Act 2010 have the same meaning as in\nthat Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Part 2\nNo. 59, 2025\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Australian Energy Regulator\nSeparation) Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nIn this Schedule:\nACCC Enterprise Agreement means the Australian Competition and\nConsumer Commission Enterprise Agreement 2024-2027 approved\nunder the Fair Work Act 2009 on 28 March 2024, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day.\namending Act means the Competition and Consumer Amendment\n(Australian Energy Regulator Separation) Act 2025.\ncommencement day means 1 July 2026.\n(2)\nExpressions used in this Schedule that are defined for the purposes of\nthe Competition and Consumer Act 2010 have the same meaning as in\nthat Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Part 2\nNo. 59, 2025\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Australian Energy Regulator\nSeparation) Act 2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-1-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47f808859adb750df5f43c745735fb11d8f4b9abfd9aec20edac015a9f7b7031",
      "skos:note": "Definitions for Schedule 2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025#sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIn this Schedule:\nACCC Enterprise Agreement means the Australian Competition and\nConsumer Commission Enterprise Agreement 2024-2027 approved\nunder the Fair Work Act 2009 on 28 March 2024, as in force\nimmediately before the commencement day.\namending Act means the Competition and Consumer Amendment\n(Australian Energy Regulator Separation) Act 2025.\ncommencement day means 1 July 2026.\n(2)\nExpressions used in this Schedule that are defined for the purposes of\nthe Competition and Consumer Act 2010 have the same meaning as in\nthat Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Part 2\nNo. 59, 2025\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Australian Energy Regulator\nSeparation) Act 2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 Delegations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025#sch-2-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to a delegation if:\n(a) the delegation was made under section 44AAH of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 before the\ncommencement day; and\n(b) the delegation is in force immediately before the\ncommencement day.\n(2)\nThe delegation continues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after\nthe commencement day, as if it were a delegation made under\nsection 44AAH of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, as\namended by the amending Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to a delegation if:\n(a) the delegation was made under section 44AAH of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 before the\ncommencement day; and\n(b) the delegation is in force immediately before the\ncommencement day.\n(2)\nThe delegation continues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after\nthe commencement day, as if it were a delegation made under\nsection 44AAH of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, as\namended by the amending Act.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-2-norm"
        },
