      "skos:definition": "(1)\nRegulations made for the purposes of paragraph (c) of the definition of\nState/Territory energy law in subsection 4(1) of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010, and in force immediately before the\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
